{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2022",
    "lib": [
      "dom",
      "dom.iterable",
      "ES2022"
    ],
    "module": "esnext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "jsx": "react-jsx",
    "allowJs": false,
    "strict": true,
    "noUncheckedIndexedAccess": true,
    "noUnusedLocals": true,
    "noUnusedParameters": true,
    "noFallthroughCasesInSwitch": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "verbatimModuleSyntax": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "incremental": true,
    "plugins": [
      {
        "name": "next"
      }
    ],
    "paths": {
      "@/*": [
        "./src/*"
      ],
      "#messages/*": [
        "./messages/*"
      ]
    }
  },
  "//include": [
    ".next/types 是 next build 的产物，里面的 validator.ts 校验每个 page/layout 的导出签名，必须保留。",
    ".next/dev/types 是 next dev 的产物，内容基本相同，但它生成的 validator.ts 带两个未使用的 import",
    "（AppRouteHandlerRoutes、NextRequest——本项目没有 route handler），会直接撞上 noUnusedLocals，",
    "让全新构建的 typecheck 必然失败。两份都 include 等于拿 dev 产物的瑕疵卡住 CI，所以只留 build 那份。",
    "注意：next dev 可能把这一项写回 tsconfig，如果 typecheck 又报 .next/dev/types 的未使用 import，删掉即可。"
  ],
  "include": [
    "next-env.d.ts",
    "**/*.ts",
    "**/*.tsx",
    ".next/types/**/*.ts",
    ".next/dev/types/**/*.ts"
  ],
  "exclude": [
    "node_modules",
    ".next/dev"
  ]
}
